# Copy to deploy/.env and adjust. See docs/SELF-HOSTING.md.

# A) Behind Tailscale Serve or another HTTPS reverse proxy:
SITE_ADDRESS=:80

# B) Public domain with Let's Encrypt (ports 80 and 443 forwarded to this machine):
# SITE_ADDRESS=les.example.com

# C) Local network with Caddy's own certificate authority:
# SITE_ADDRESS=https://192.168.1.50
# TLS_DIRECTIVE=tls internal
